{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.2021b.q29.material.recovered", "text": "根据下列材料，按要求完成任务：某教师在进行“血管”一节的教学时，主要教学环节如下：A.教师组织学生用低倍镜显微镜观察小鱼尾鳍的血管及血液流动情况，将观察到的现象用绘图或文字的方式进行记录，然后组织学生以小组为单位分享观察结果。B.教师引导学生针对各小组描述的观察现象，从血液流动速度血液方向等方面，对不同血管的特点进行分析和总结。C.教师播放小鱼尾鳍血液流动情况的视频。D.教师组织学生进一步观察人体循环系统的示意图，引导学生梳理不同血管以心脏之间血液流动方向的关系，并书写板图和板书。E.理论联系实际，通过问题引导学生思考相关的生活现象。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ee65cf62ebbc273d4a49bb1e2caad0ec7d81428b07e36812ff66b149481d02da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4287, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4557, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "ee65cf62ebbc273d4a49bb1e2caad0ec7d81428b07e36812ff66b149481d02da"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.2021b.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.s1.k06", "ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.308.r001", "ntce.outline.308.r012", "ntce.outline.308.r014", "ntce.outline.308.r015", "ntce.outline.308.r017", "ntce.outline.308.r018", "ntce.outline.308.r019"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shengwu.2021b.q29"], "word_count": 270, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ee65cf62ebbc273d4a49bb1e2caad0ec7d81428b07e36812ff66b149481d02da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4287, "decoded_csv_character_end"